+        '\\textbf{The measure.} On the house machine there is no measure of the tape or of the process without a question to the inscription: counting with a '
+        'number is inscribing a tape of marks; the length of a tape unfolds into an \\texttt{if} per cell; the instant of halting is the first “no”. If the '
