+        '\\textbf{The support-vector machine and the Name.} Definition of the theory: a support-vector machine is the placed space where something can dwell, '
+        'which gives the return phase something to refer to and leaves the read registered. The Lean kernel is one: given the hypotheses and the axioms, a '
